WEBVTT

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.616
but it's important for us
to sharpen each other,

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:33.256
so that we all can rise.

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:34.839
MB: That's beautiful, thank you.

00:10:34.853 --> 00:10:37.173
(Applause)

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:42.576
So you all are doing work

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:47.296
that forces you to face
some brutal, painful realities

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:48.520
on a daily basis.

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:51.776
What gives you hope

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:54.080
and inspires you in that context?

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:58.296
PC: I am hopeful for black futures.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:02.536
And I say that because
we live in a society